// Title: Acct Mgr User Removed From Group
// Description: Hunts for acct mgr user removed from group
// MITRE ATT&CK: T1531
// Severity: informational
// FalsePositives:
//   - Aktivitas account management oleh admin yang sah.
AccountManagementEvents | where EventID == 4729 or EventID == 4733 or EventID == 4757
